    {
      "text": "The mHero logo: the wordmark 'mHero' in blue and grey text with a small wifi/signal-style icon. mHero is the combined communication tool described on the page, built from iHRIS, RapidPro and OpenHIM, shown as a component of Fig. 5.6.2 illustrating how mHero integrates digital health interventions using standards.",
      "state": "draft",
